{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Datalust.Seq","latestVersion":"11.0.17526.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"The self-hosted search, analysis, and alerting server built for structured logs and traces.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://datalust.co/doc/eula-current.pdf","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"The self-hosted search, analysis, and alerting server built for structured logs and traces.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://datalust.co/doc/eula-current.pdf","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Structured logs are the observability pillar that uniquely models your apps and services. They capture the detailed, domain-specific events you need to debug tough problems, and they're perfect for monitoring and analyzing system behavior in real time.\nSeq is built from the ground up for modern structured logging. Events are captured as fully-structured JSON data, and Seq's query language makes it natural to search and manipulate them without awkward parsing or format handling.\nSeq accepts logs via HTTP, OpenTelemetry/OTLP, custom inputs, and the seqcli command-line client, with plug-ins or integrations available for .NET, Java, Node.js, Python, Ruby, Go, Docker, message queues, and many other technologies.","moniker":"seq","name":"Seq","packageUrl":"https://datalust.co/seq","publisher":"Datalust Pty Ltd","publisherUrl":"https://datalust.co/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/datalust/seq-tickets/milestone/201?closed=1","tags":["log","logging","structured-log","structured-logging"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"专为结构化日志与追踪设计的自托管服务器，提供搜索、分析与告警功能。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"结构化日志是观测体系中的核心支柱，它能为您的应用和服务建立专属数据模型。通过捕获领域内精细化的关键事件，结构化日志既能有效诊断复杂故障，又为实时监控与系统行为分析提供了理想解决方案。\nSeq 专为现代化结构化日志而生。所有事件均以完整 JSON 结构捕获，其独创的查询语言让日志检索与处理变得直观高效，彻底告别繁琐的解析与格式转换。\nSeq 支持 HTTP、OpenTelemetry/OTLP 协议、自定义输入源及 seqcli 命令行等多种日志接入方式，并提供 .NET、Java、Node.js、Python、Ruby、Go、Docker、消息队列等海量技术的插件与集成方案。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/datalust/seq-tickets/milestone/201?closed=1","tags":["日志","结构化日志"]}},"longDescription":"Structured logs are the observability pillar that uniquely models your apps and services. They capture the detailed, domain-specific events you need to debug tough problems, and they're perfect for monitoring and analyzing system behavior in real time.\nSeq is built from the ground up for modern structured logging. Events are captured as fully-structured JSON data, and Seq's query language makes it natural to search and manipulate them without awkward parsing or format handling.\nSeq accepts logs via HTTP, OpenTelemetry/OTLP, custom inputs, and the seqcli command-line client, with plug-ins or integrations available for .NET, Java, Node.js, Python, Ruby, Go, Docker, message queues, and many other technologies.","moniker":"seq","name":"Seq","packageUrl":"https://datalust.co/seq","publisher":"Datalust Pty Ltd","publisherUrl":"https://datalust.co/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/datalust/seq-tickets/milestone/201?closed=1","tags":["log","logging","structured-log","structured-logging"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/11.0.17526.0/app.json","detailSha256":"4ab72bc82a844570477f8fd37b5f57ab0bec684171b503ac1e1b147ab45c591b","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"11.0.17526.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/11.0.17473.0/app.json","detailSha256":"9f28ed45ad8a6736f8de37ad354f34a79bf78464517c8c568a56510952d19f74","releaseDate":"2026-10-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"11.0.17473.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/11.0.17182.0/app.json","detailSha256":"f89072c9b9847cf14ee7a2e11cb60005d84f7c674357ca3339fc5d9f13209beb","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"11.0.17182.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/11.0.17114.0/app.json","detailSha256":"9520026a783edbc9194b735e59b85c5fe